WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:04,980
Which hospital is the First People's Hospital?

2
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:10,340
Mr. Shen, Ward 7012, Zhu Yuanbu

3
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:11,780
I just came back from the hospital

4
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:14,260
When I left, he just fell asleep and I explained the work.

5
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:16,460
Just go back and make some soup for him. You don’t have to go.

6
00:00:17,370 --> 00:00:18,730
I'll have someone pack soup and deliver it to him.

7
00:00:19,610 --> 00:00:27,150
Bai Yuhang

8
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:28,900
Take a trip to really build a house

9
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,500
Buy some light sulfur stone

10
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:31,860
Sent to the First People's Hospital

11
00:00:31,860 --> 00:00:34,500
Within half an hour in Ward 7012 of Zhu Yuanbu

12
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:41,580
I will be superhuman in half an hour. Can I fly there?
